6B0F0116"}, "display_name": "Shopenkraft's Magic Goods", "keywords": ["MagicCrafting", "PotionBrewing", "WeaponForging", "FantasyVr", "ShopSimulation"], "long_description": "Step into the world of **Shopenkraft's Magic Goods**, a unique VR experience that transports you to a fantastical realm. In this universe, strange monsters are vanquished by stranger heroes\u2014but behind every hero is a well-stocked magic shop. Become the go-to artisan in a cozy crafting simulation, where you'll create the perfect gear for every daring explorer.\n\nWhat Awaits You in **Shopenkraft's Magic Goods**:\n\n- Immerse yourself in a world where magic and skill come together. Use your talents to craft magical items tailored to the needs of your unusual clientele.\n- Get started easily with our new tutorial and gameplay progression, guiding you naturally as you learn the ropes and deepen your crafting expertise.\n- Progress through 10 exciting levels, unlocking new recipes and ingredients as you advance. Each level presents fresh challenges and new crafting possibilities.\n- Enjoy expanded features and content, shaped by feedback from our Alpha testers. We\u2019ve listened to your thoughts and made improvements for an even better experience!\n\n**Join Us in Early Access!** Download now and dive into our magical universe. Share your thoughts and feedback with us on Discord: https://discord.gg/QnkZjqym2t. \n\nYour journey as a master crafter begins here!", "short_description": "Shopenkraft's Magic Goods is a VR experience that lets you play the role of a magical shopkeeper!"}]}, "developer_name": "Ingenious Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://shorturl.at/UmUXt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ingenious Studios", "support_website_url": "https://www.ingenious-studios.com/contact", "website_url": "https://www.ingenious-studios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035